        "label": "VMware Live Site Recovery degraded and suspended mode",
        "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/live-recovery/live-recovery-appliance/9-0-5/create-a-site-pairing/vmware-live-site-recovery-degraded-and-suspended-mode.html"
